{"3795810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dominus Automa", "steam_appid": 3795810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/394ba5c29702e8bd2024ec56dad26646.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/394ba5c29702e8bd2024ec56dad26646.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join the Playest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/fd1b39ecc45c1e03e81cd1199a3495eb.avif?t=1788169903\" width=1200 height=936 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/6e947a9f9a29adc7101837dc919eadf4.webp?t=1788169903\" width=1334 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8e8ed99e652547ba934c3597d3006508.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/8e8ed99e652547ba934c3597d3006508.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominus Automa is an automated IDLE Online RPG created for players who love deep progression systems but no longer have time for endless grinding. Your hero lives on the server 24/7 - training, fighting, crafting and growing stronger even while you are offline. Explore a living online world filled with thousands of players, interacting and progressing together regardless of who is currently connected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The adventure goes on - always</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/9469cf77f5dca5e27c3f37519b607fb6.poster.avif?t=1788169903\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/9469cf77f5dca5e27c3f37519b607fb6.webm?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/9469cf77f5dca5e27c3f37519b607fb6.mp4?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/ebbb70401d7f94b17373c11b1fd04486.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/ebbb70401d7f94b17373c11b1fd04486.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in complete control of your hero's behavior: skills, combat style, priorities, reactions to danger, and long-term goals. Through smart automation, your hero acts independently, following the logic you design. Choose your own path and specialize in PvE, PvP, exploration, crafting, gathering, or any other activity that suits your playstyle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The hero awaits your command, Dominus</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/747e0eb517ae3717569350b025147bd3.poster.avif?t=1788169903\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/747e0eb517ae3717569350b025147bd3.webm?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/747e0eb517ae3717569350b025147bd3.mp4?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/5f8b475a1806cdafa09328a4c859736c.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/5f8b475a1806cdafa09328a4c859736c.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the core MMORPG experiences such as boss fights, dungeons, guild wars or shared world exploration. Become a part of a player-driven economy, where every hero has a role to play. Team up with your allies in guilds to overcome varied challenges, strengthen your companions with crafted items, and compete for influence across the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Become a part of a living online world</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1bbd893b97de9deb204ada88ae4fa24c.poster.avif?t=1788169903\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1bbd893b97de9deb204ada88ae4fa24c.webm?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/1bbd893b97de9deb204ada88ae4fa24c.mp4?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/ae53ef4e94b5f17ae26e8a7502b83572.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/ae53ef4e94b5f17ae26e8a7502b83572.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more pressure of grind or daily play sessions. Dominus Automa is built for grown-up players who enjoy shaping strategies, making meaningful decisions, and watching their plans evolve at their own pace. Check your hero’s progress whenever you feel like it, adjust priorities, and issue commands remotely - even from your phone. With written and voice commands, you can guide your character hands-free in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No manual grind, crucial decisions only</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/ea3b164f3965f290267cae2c0b80d446.poster.avif?t=1788169903\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/ea3b164f3965f290267cae2c0b80d446.webm?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/ea3b164f3965f290267cae2c0b80d446.mp4?t=1788169903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/6e947a9f9a29adc7101837dc919eadf4.webp?t=1788169903\" width=1334 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/06a96bdc195681f1676dcad5ea720420.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras_big/06a96bdc195681f1676dcad5ea720420.webp?t=1788169903 width=1560 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>IDLE gameplay</strong> allowing you to craft your hero's priorities, combat style, reactions and long-term goals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Ongoing adventure - </strong>even while you are offline, the world and its systems continue to evolve - always!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Full-scale Online RPG experience </strong>with player-driven economy, group content, guilds, crafting and world exploration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>No manual grind, meaningful decisions only - </strong>check on your progress, adjust actions and make fateful decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Numerous ways to play and grow</strong> with no pressure on daily sessions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/5fc218b5cb0e49bf91407b8bfab0cd88.avif?t=1788169903\" width=780 height=252 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/6e947a9f9a29adc7101837dc919eadf4.webp?t=1788169903\" width=1334 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795810/extras/8e8ed99e652547ba934c3597d3006508.avif?t=1788169903\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app